+    t141: a nudge is a prompt that carries an SV, and the owner's rule («если задание пришло с SV, то этот
+    SV md5 должен стать parent-goal-md5») makes a robot answer it by taking the NUDGE's md5 as its parent —
+    measured 2026-10-22 06:27 (t135's parent-goal-md5 was the nudge's md5, not the brief's). So the nudge
+    names the brief md5 as the parent to keep, and names its own md5 as a parent it must NOT take."""
